0,Ata Manobo language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ata_Manobo_language,Ata is a Manobo language of northeastern Mindanao of the Philippines.Austronesian language spoken in the Philippines. Not to be confused with Ata language or Ata language (Negros).,"Manobo, Ata",Austronesian
